v 3
d duvm: Deaton's unit-value model - quality-corrected price and expenditure elasticities from budget shares and unit values
d
d Author: Abdelkrim Araar, Universite Laval / PEP
d Support: aabd@ecn.ulaval.ca
d Version : 1.1.2
d License : GPL-3.0-or-later
d
d Deaton (1988, 1990, 1997 ch. 5): within-cluster first stage, between-cluster
d second stage with the errors-in-variables correction, quality shading through
d the separability parameter, completion of the system, approximate Slutsky
d symmetry. Linearized (influence-function) variance by cluster or by survey
d design (svyset), design bootstrap of both stages, diagnostics (duvmdiag,
d estat diagnostics), dialog box, Engel curves after estimation (predict,
d estat engel), correction of the unit values for the selection of the buyers
d (selection, selgoods(), selvars(): Heckman, probit in the standard errors).
d Option compat reproduces the code published with Deaton's book.
d
d Requires: Stata 14.2 or later
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260926
d
f src/duvm.ado
f src/_duvm_tabstars.ado
f src/duvm.sthlp
f src/duvm.dlg
f src/duvm_estat.ado
f src/duvm_p.ado
f src/_duvm_engel.ado
f src/_duvm_uv.ado
f src/duvmdiag.ado
f src/duvmdiag.sthlp
f examples/mexico_2014_cereals.dta
f examples/duvm_tour.do
